    "rich_text_intro": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you like butter chicken, you will love this butter pumpkin shrimp. It is sweet and creamy with warming spices and a bit of heat from the Fresno. Cilantro lime basmati and toasted coconut keep it feeling bright, fragrant and deeply satisfying.</p><p>Two things carry it. The sauce gets its body from roasted squash in a blender rather than an hour of reducing, and the shrimp go in at the very end &mdash; three or four minutes, judged by how far they curl rather than by the clock.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
