            "custom_icon": "",
            "heading": "About 50 minutes",
            "text": "<p>The pumpkin roasts and the rice cooks while you do everything else, so the hands-on time is closer to twenty minutes. The shrimp are the last four.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
