            "heading": "Blended, not reduced",
            "text": "<p>Roasted kabocha and a can of coconut milk through a blender. That is where the body comes from &mdash; no long simmer, no cream.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
